  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SME Guarantee Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective of the project is an increase in local banks lending to SMEs, improving access to finance for SMEs on a sustainable basis. The ultimate objective of the project is to promote job creation. This objective is fully in line with the new EU approach to its Southern Neighbourhood and the new EU Development Policy document &apos;&apos;An Agenda for Change&apos;&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
